Hello! 

I just ported the autofs script (v1.15) to slackware 9.1. the modified file
is appended.

Just a little correction concerning the sample auto.master:
These lines describe the syntax of the file:

# This is an automounter map and it has the following format
# key [ -mount-options-separated-by-comma ] location

while the syntax description should be something like this:

# mountdir configfile [options]
Er... I don't think this are really the right definitions, I'm not working
on my PC right now, so I cant consult the manpage...

Greets

Simon


